                                                "example_id": "146d2e21-a14a-471f-9189-d7c985ae1cc5",
                                                "sense_id": "8bc3fa2a-0a61-337a-bbf9-54f6df208b56",
                                                "text": "\"You really touch the limit,\" said he. \"You enlarge my view of the possible. Cerebral paresis! Mental inertia! Wonderful!\" He was too absurd to make me angry."
